## Evidence taxonomy (this folder only)

| Class | Definition | Current AQARION-GAP status |
|-------|------------|----------------------------|
| **[P]** | Written mathematical proof with explicit assumptions | Gap identity + four-way \(d_T\) — **yes** |
| **[V]** | Exhaustive check on a finite, declared domain | n=6 stdlib: 20 503 pairs, 0 mismatches — **yes**; n=7/8 reported — supporting |
| **[FV]** | Lean (or other) kernel accepts fully discharged proof | **No** — scaffold has intentional `sorry` |
| **[CV]** | Randomized / sampled computational support | Not the primary evidence here |
| **[O]** | Open problem | Lean discharge; optional representation-robust second implementation |

**Rule:** Never write `[FV]` in README, CI summary, or commit messages while any `sorry`/`admit` remains in the proof path of the claimed theorem.

