## What CI is allowed to claim

**Allowed**

- `verify-gap-n6.py` passed / failed (exit code, pair count, mismatch count).
- `lake build` exit code and sorry count.
- “Scaffold present”; “algebraic proof [P]”; “finite regression [V]”.

**Forbidden**

- “Formally verified”, “theorem proved in Lean”, “C4 ready”, “publication ready”.
- Silent upgrade of evidence class without a new artifact (discharged Lean file + green hard CI).

