## Change control

1. Mathematical statement change → update paper note + Lean statement + Python oracle in the same PR when possible.
2. Representation change (tuple vs frozenset vs bitmask) → update `verify-gap-n6.py` assertions and document in this file.
3. Evidence-class upgrade → only after CI green **and** explicit human acknowledgment in PR description.
